We present this magnificent newly built 3-bedroom apartment, located in Santa Clara, one of the most sought-after residential areas of Coimbra. Featuring contemporary architecture, high-quality finishes and excellent comfort solutions, this property has been designed to provide a modern and functional living experience.

The main highlights of this property include:

- Two suites;

- One bedroom;

- Three bathrooms;

- Furnished and fully equipped kitchen;

- Spacious living room;

- Parking space in a private enclosed garage with a gate.

The apartment is located close to Coimbra city centre, with easy access to a wide range of services and commercial areas.

An excellent opportunity for those looking for a modern family apartment with premium finishes, a privileged location and excellent access to Coimbra city centre, schools, services and the main road connections.

For further information or to schedule a viewing, please contact us. This could be your next home in Santa Clara.

